### Variables globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@figureverse.com
@adminPassword = admin123

### 1. Login Admin (Obtener Bearer Token)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Token capturado desde el login (o reemplazar manualmente)
@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

---

### 2. Obtener catálogos dinámicos (categorías, marcas, universos, escalas, badges)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/catalogs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

---

### 3. Listar todos los productos (sin filtros)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

---

### 4. Listar productos filtrando por texto (q), categoría y estado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products?q=goku&categoria=anime&estado=activos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

---

### 5. Obtener detalle de un producto por ID (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

---

### 6. Obtener producto inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

---

### 7. Crear un producto válido (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gojo Satoru Edición Especial",
  "universe": "Jujutsu Kaisen",
  "category": "anime",
  "price": 189.99,
  "oldPrice": 220.00,
  "scale": "1/7",
  "brand": "Kotobukiya",
  "stock": 10,
  "rating": 4.9,
  "reviews": 45,
  "badge": "new",
  "image": "",
  "description": "Figura coleccionable de Satoru Gojo usando el Vacío Infinito."
}

---

### 8. Crear un producto inválido - Prueba de validación 400 Bad Request (oldPrice <= price)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Figura Inválida Precio",
  "universe": "Dragon Ball",
  "category": "anime",
  "price": 150.00,
  "oldPrice": 120.00,
  "scale": "1/8",
  "brand": "Bandai",
  "stock": 5
}

---

### 9. Crear un producto inválido - Categoría no permitida (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Figura Categoría Inválida",
  "universe": "Otro",
  "category": "deportes",
  "price": 100.00,
  "stock": 3
}

---

### 10. Actualizar un producto existente (200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Superman Unidad Edición Deluxe",
  "universe": "DC Comics",
  "category": "superheroes",
  "price": 270.00,
  "oldPrice": 350.00,
  "scale": "1/6",
  "brand": "S.H.Figuarts",
  "stock": 12,
  "rating": 4.9,
  "reviews": 135,
  "badge": "sale",
  "image": "assets/img/image.png",
  "description": "Superman con capa de tela flexible, base especial y manos intercambiables."
}

---

### 11. Cambiar estado activo/inactivo de un producto (PATCH 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activo": false
}

---

### 12. Reactivar producto (PATCH 200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/products/1/estado
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activo": true
}

